WEBVTT

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling, open up your eyes!

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling me wo akete

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
It is in this world's evil den

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
Kono yo no aku no soukutsu de

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
You shall receive a rare heart

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
Tsuibamareru kokoro hoshikute

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Escaping is impossible

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Nige mo dekinu

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
My imprisoned, pale-faced prince

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
Yuuhei no souhaku no ouji yo

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
I am a goddess

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
Watashi ga megami

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Kami-chama Karin

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Mini-Goddess Karin

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
In this ward, you have to poach everything

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
Subete wa mitsuryouku

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
With a hidden snare

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
Usumoreta wana ni

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
If you entrap them

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
Hamerareru no nara

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
You'll want to destroy them too…

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
Konagona ni kudaite hoshii wa

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
To die from natural causes or imcompetence

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
Shi ni itaranu yamai

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
It's all poison to your heart

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
Shinzou ni ha pawazon

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
A rose melting in the flames of purgatory

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
Rengoku no homura de zero kara

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Let's redeem this world…

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Saisei shimashou

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
A black dahlia in the nightless city's sky

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
Fuyoru no sora de kuroi daria

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
A lost delusion, a falling reality

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
Shisuru mousou ochiru genjitsu

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Struggling in hell like an ant

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Mogake ari jigoku

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling, give me your voice!

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling koe agete

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
For right now, our limits will have to change

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
Kono ima sashichigaeru hodo

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
If we want for the most important thing

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
Daiji na mono ga hoshii no nara

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Discover the result of your prayers

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Inori wa hatete

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Your princess is dying in prison

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Rougoku de shouten no himegimi

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
You are such a devil…

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
Anata ga maou

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Hate's fist and grief's wounds, too

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Ikari no ken mo nageki no kizu mo

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Dissolving, vanishing, unraveling, passing away, without a trace

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Atokata mo naku tokete kiete chitte utakata

00:01:31.350 --> 00:01:35.700
Reunion with Shii-chan

00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:53.640
Toilet… Toilet…

00:01:58.130 --> 00:02:00.770
That's a lot of locks…

00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:02.130
I wonder what that room's for…

00:02:21.190 --> 00:02:22.870
Is it my imagination?

00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:25.390
I'm sure something was there…

00:02:29.560 --> 00:02:32.080
That's kind of creepy.

00:02:33.320 --> 00:02:34.640
I should just get to sleep.

00:02:40.690 --> 00:02:42.090
What's that?

00:03:00.670 --> 00:03:03.230
W-Was that Shii-chan?!

00:03:03.230 --> 00:03:08.110
But… Shii-chan… Shii-chan should be dead!

00:03:08.110 --> 00:03:09.280
But that means…

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:18.520
Shii-chan's gho-gho-

00:03:19.810 --> 00:03:21.890
What's wrong, Karin?

00:03:27.330 --> 00:03:29.140
Hey, what's wrong?

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:30.300
Are you okay?

00:03:30.300 --> 00:03:31.500
What happened?

00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:33.580
Sh-Shi-Shii.

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:36.100
Huh? Is there something in your room?

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:40.030
There's nothing.

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:44.430
Bug!!!

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:45.350
Eh?

00:03:45.590 --> 00:03:50.040
Yay~ Spider found!

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:55.240
Uh… It's not the spider…

00:03:56.680 --> 00:03:58.240
Shii-chan?

00:03:58.520 --> 00:04:03.010
Yeah, my cat Shii-chan, that should be dead.

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:08.130
I'm sure, because I neglected his grave, he came back as a ghost.

00:04:08.130 --> 00:04:10.490
I'm sorry, Shii-chan!

00:04:10.490 --> 00:04:13.740
For someone who threw him out the window, that's a lot to say.

00:04:13.740 --> 00:04:18.020
Well, the ghost Shii-chan is scary!

00:04:19.660 --> 00:04:23.350
Anyway, are you sure that cat was Shii-chan?

00:04:23.990 --> 00:04:31.070
I think so, his face and body… although there was a weird star on his forehead…

00:04:31.760 --> 00:04:33.000
A star on his forehead… ?

00:04:33.440 --> 00:04:36.120
That was… Shii-chan!

00:04:36.120 --> 00:04:39.440
I've always been with him, so I know!

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:40.640
Kazune-kun?

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:45.370
There's something interesting me… you should get some sleep.

00:04:46.370 --> 00:04:48.050
Kazune-kun…

00:04:48.530 --> 00:04:51.170
Goodnight.

00:04:51.170 --> 00:04:52.050
Huh!?

00:04:52.050 --> 00:04:53.780
What's wrong?

00:04:54.420 --> 00:04:58.100
I completely forgot that I had to go to the bathroom!

00:05:06.870 --> 00:05:07.910
Kazune-kun?

00:05:09.230 --> 00:05:10.190
K-Karin.

00:05:10.510 --> 00:05:12.790
What's in here?

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:15.640
There were lots of locks on it, so I was wondering…

00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:19.280
H-Hey, what's in it?

00:05:19.280 --> 00:05:21.200
Is this a storeroom?

00:05:21.200 --> 00:05:22.200
Or…

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:23.690
It's nothing!

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:25.570
Kazune-kun…

00:05:26.610 --> 00:05:31.090
I'm sorry for shouting, but it's got nothing to do with you.

00:05:31.330 --> 00:05:34.740
So please, just stay away from here.

00:05:34.740 --> 00:05:35.020
Please.

00:05:35.780 --> 00:05:36.980
Kazune-kun?

00:05:37.740 --> 00:05:39.740
I'm going to sleep for today.

00:05:41.060 --> 00:05:43.700
What could this place be?

00:05:43.700 --> 00:05:48.270
And anyway, with that kind of attitude, there is no way it could be nothing!

00:05:48.550 --> 00:05:53.430
I see! It must be where he hides all his porn books.

00:05:54.230 --> 00:05:56.960
Karin-chan will expose everything!

00:05:57.800 --> 00:05:58.400
But…

00:05:58.720 --> 00:05:59.040
Please.

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:03.920
I wonder why Kazune-kun gave me such a worried face.

00:06:12.530 --> 00:06:13.410
We're late!

00:06:13.410 --> 00:06:18.420
That's because Kazune-chan didn't wake up this morning.

00:06:18.580 --> 00:06:20.180
Is it my fault?

00:06:20.580 --> 00:06:25.500
I was thinking about the spirit cat last night, and it got really late.

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:28.150
Eh? About the ghost Shii-chan?

00:06:28.510 --> 00:06:32.910
I haven't seen the cat, so I can't say for sure, but…

00:06:33.350 --> 00:06:35.450
So it is a ghost…

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:42.400
If that's true, then that is your cat, but it isn't.

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:44.400
What's that supposed to mean?

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:45.320
A riddle?

00:06:45.320 --> 00:06:46.400
A spell?

00:06:46.400 --> 00:06:48.450
Some sort of charm?

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:56.170
W-Wait…

00:07:02.660 --> 00:07:04.780
Okay, that's it!

00:07:06.180 --> 00:07:07.500
How did you find it?

00:07:07.750 --> 00:07:10.230
It was so-so.

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:13.150
Okay then, let's collect the tests from the back.

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:19.600
Springing a pop-quiz like that. That was too sudden.

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:23.560
I didn't think I'd get this till now, but…

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:27.640
As expected, I didn't know a thing!

00:07:27.640 --> 00:07:30.810
This time it'll be zero points again.

00:07:31.210 --> 00:07:31.530
Hey.

00:07:32.490 --> 00:07:33.210
Huh?

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:34.010
Was it bad?

00:07:35.410 --> 00:07:38.250
Yep, completely hopeless.

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:39.580
And you're proud of this?

00:07:39.900 --> 00:07:41.700
Well…

00:07:42.220 --> 00:07:48.500
Well, Karin just transferred here, so… it can't be helped, right?

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:53.000
~die~

00:07:59.390 --> 00:08:03.960
Well, let's save this conversation for later!

00:08:10.530 --> 00:08:12.570
- This is pretty tiring.

00:08:11.570 --> 00:08:15.650
- Yay~ it was completely hopeless!

00:08:15.650 --> 00:08:17.410
Yay!

00:08:17.410 --> 00:08:21.260
I didn't get a thing.

00:08:21.260 --> 00:08:24.260
You too, that's good.

00:08:24.420 --> 00:08:27.860
How did you find it, Miyon-chan?

00:08:27.860 --> 00:08:31.630
Eh? That was identical to the spring homework.

00:08:32.030 --> 00:08:36.950
Ah, you're from earlier… Hanazono-san!

00:08:37.310 --> 00:08:40.510
Ah, yeah, Karin is fine!

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:46.600
Miyon, we reserved a table for you.

00:08:47.200 --> 00:08:49.320
Ah, Yuki!

00:08:50.600 --> 00:08:53.730
You didn't have to do that, Yuki.

00:08:54.330 --> 00:08:57.650
Ah, but I was wondering if you were going to come.

00:08:57.930 --> 00:09:01.330
Why you also both came to the cafeteria, Himeka and Karin?

00:09:01.650 --> 00:09:06.740
Because today we overslept and didn't make any lunches.

00:09:07.140 --> 00:09:11.180
Huh? Were you in our grade school?

00:09:11.180 --> 00:09:13.550
Are you a transfer student?

00:09:14.430 --> 00:09:18.110
Ah, Karin, you don't know him.

00:09:18.110 --> 00:09:19.710
This is Sakurai.

00:09:20.550 --> 00:09:23.720
I'm Sakurai Yuki, nice to meet you.

00:09:24.120 --> 00:09:28.280
I'm Hanazono Karin, nice to meet you too.

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:30.720
A transfer student, huh?

00:09:30.720 --> 00:09:32.940
Wow, you must be amazingly smart.

00:09:32.940 --> 00:09:36.770
Ah, not really, not amazing at all.

00:09:36.770 --> 00:09:38.330
Yep, not amazing.

00:09:38.330 --> 00:09:40.610
You, shut up!

00:09:40.690 --> 00:09:45.860
Hey, hey, Karin-chan, let's go buy food.

00:09:46.140 --> 00:09:48.300
Ah, yeah, let's go, let's go.

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:51.700
What should we have…

00:09:53.100 --> 00:09:55.150
They have so many menus!

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:57.150
They even have ice-cream!

00:09:58.350 --> 00:10:02.670
You're the first person I've ever seen to be so happy about cafeteria food.

00:10:02.670 --> 00:10:05.960
That's because everything looks so good!

00:10:05.960 --> 00:10:09.880
I want a curry cutlet!

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:12.400
Is that… ?!

00:10:13.360 --> 00:10:15.690
My favorite eel bread.

00:10:20.050 --> 00:10:21.850
Ah, you're…

00:10:22.610 --> 00:10:23.570
You're…

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:26.170
Here.

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:29.060
It's tasty, isn't it? Eel bread.

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:31.700
Ah, yes, but that's…

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:36.830
I'm fine, I like this chestnut bread too.

00:10:36.830 --> 00:10:41.990
And besides, girls that smile are a sight to see, right?

00:10:43.590 --> 00:10:45.750
Thank you!

00:10:47.400 --> 00:10:51.560
What's the matter, Karin-chan?

00:10:51.560 --> 00:10:55.960
You saw, that senpai gave her bread.

00:10:56.400 --> 00:11:00.890
At times like that, you should really give it to your senpai…

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:03.770
Ah, welcome back.

00:11:03.770 --> 00:11:08.740
What took you so long? Girls are so slow.

00:11:09.420 --> 00:11:14.140
You're so annoying… but in exchange…

00:11:15.420 --> 00:11:16.980
What's with her?

00:11:17.950 --> 00:11:19.310
Weird girl.

00:11:25.230 --> 00:11:27.150
What are you doing, Kirika?

00:11:27.590 --> 00:11:32.760
Ah, nii-san, I was giving it to that girl.

00:11:32.760 --> 00:11:33.720
That girl?

00:11:33.720 --> 00:11:35.720
Ah, that amateur goddess?

00:11:37.040 --> 00:11:41.330
She's cute, she gave me round eyes for the eel bread.

00:11:41.330 --> 00:11:42.570
Eel bread?

00:11:42.570 --> 00:11:43.370
What are you talking about?

00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:47.530
Don't worry, I'm just talking to myself.

00:11:49.820 --> 00:11:51.860
I'm home!

00:11:51.860 --> 00:11:56.740
The test was hopeless, but at least I made a new friend today!

00:11:57.100 --> 00:11:59.830
And I got to meet that guy!

00:12:10.640 --> 00:12:14.040
No!!!

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:17.600
It came out again! It came out again! Shii-chan's ghost!

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:27.290
Oh no… is nobody here?

00:12:28.050 --> 00:12:31.180
Himeka-chan was on cleaning duty…

00:12:31.940 --> 00:12:35.220
But Kazune-kun should have been home before me.

00:12:42.870 --> 00:12:46.110
That door with all the locks is… open.

00:12:46.730 --> 00:12:47.720
Is it grilled
eel over rice?

00:12:48.800 --> 00:12:51.260
I am God!

00:12:54.970 --> 00:12:56.220
You moron.

00:12:55.200 --> 00:12:56.220
It's a croquette!

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:02.850
The door's… open.

00:13:05.810 --> 00:13:06.810
A basement?

00:13:07.570 --> 00:13:10.130
What could be down there?

00:13:10.770 --> 00:13:13.500
So please, just stay away from here.

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:14.180
Please.

00:13:17.460 --> 00:13:18.980
I think I better stop.

00:13:33.920 --> 00:13:35.800
K-Karin.

00:13:35.800 --> 00:13:36.880
Why are you here?

00:13:36.880 --> 00:13:42.440
Sorry, the door was open, so I thought I'd peep in a bit…

00:13:42.440 --> 00:13:45.490
Then, my feet slipped and…

00:13:47.930 --> 00:13:49.610
Well, let's go.

00:13:49.610 --> 00:13:50.490
Eh?

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:53.210
Ouch…

00:13:53.210 --> 00:13:53.890
What's wrong?

00:13:54.420 --> 00:13:58.300
It's just my leg… I'm fine.

00:13:58.660 --> 00:14:00.500
Ah, Kazune-kun…

00:14:07.510 --> 00:14:10.310
Wow. That's a lot of books.

00:14:11.270 --> 00:14:14.070
Sit over there, and wait a bit.

00:14:14.070 --> 00:14:15.000
Okay.

00:14:23.400 --> 00:14:26.690
No porn books…

00:14:26.770 --> 00:14:30.450
Medical Science? Sounds difficult.

00:14:39.380 --> 00:14:41.180
Eh, what?

00:14:41.180 --> 00:14:42.100
Where is this?

00:14:43.540 --> 00:14:47.350
Who's that… he looks so sad.

00:14:48.430 --> 00:14:49.990
Karin, Karin!

00:14:51.430 --> 00:14:53.070
Kazune-kun…

00:14:53.070 --> 00:14:54.550
What's wrong, Karin?

00:14:55.990 --> 00:14:58.200
I-I don't know, it's just…

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:05.360
There are lots of things I can't tell you.

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:06.280
Eh?

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:11.890
Try asking something, I'll tell you everything, as much as I can.

00:15:12.330 --> 00:15:13.890
Kazune-kun.

00:15:14.450 --> 00:15:15.350
Okay!

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:15.850
Yes?

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:18.060
What is "God's power"?

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:19.980
Who is this goddess you've been talking about?

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:21.500
And who is that glasses guy?

00:15:22.660 --> 00:15:24.780
Don't ask so many at once…

00:15:24.780 --> 00:15:27.830
I'm not Prince Shoutoku.

00:15:24.780 --> 00:15:33.430
Prince Shoutoku was a legendary prince who could have 8 conversations at once.

00:15:27.830 --> 00:15:33.430
Okay then, first, what should we do?

00:15:33.470 --> 00:15:38.110
If we don't protect Himeka-chan, she'll disappear.

00:15:38.560 --> 00:15:40.800
Did you hear that from Himeka?

00:15:41.400 --> 00:15:44.840
I did… What is this mean?

00:15:44.840 --> 00:15:47.360
Is Himeka-chan sick?

00:15:47.360 --> 00:15:50.490
No, their target is Himeka.

00:15:51.610 --> 00:15:56.250
"Their"? As in that glasses guy and goddess?

00:15:56.250 --> 00:15:58.330
They're targeting Himeka-chan?

00:15:58.730 --> 00:16:07.020
I don't really know the details, until now, those two have never really attacked, just looked around.

00:16:08.580 --> 00:16:12.830
Sorry, in the end, I don't really know what to do.

00:16:20.840 --> 00:16:23.360
- Alright! Let's protect her!

00:16:23.040 --> 00:16:23.360
- Karin…

00:16:23.760 --> 00:16:27.600
It comes down to the fact that we just need to protect Himeka-chan!

00:16:27.600 --> 00:16:30.610
Now that I know that, I can work hard to do that!

00:16:30.930 --> 00:16:33.770
Don't make such a salty face!

00:16:33.770 --> 00:16:35.570
Stand tall! Be strong!

00:16:38.690 --> 00:16:42.020
You're really interesting.

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:43.580
What do you mean?..

00:16:43.580 --> 00:16:47.180
I'm glad you're on my side, Karin.

00:16:48.100 --> 00:16:49.340
It's nothing…

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:52.350
Okay then, let's go back.

00:16:52.590 --> 00:16:53.510
Eh?

00:16:53.510 --> 00:16:56.310
Come on, you're leg hurts, right?

00:17:05.640 --> 00:17:08.120
What is this feeling…

00:17:08.120 --> 00:17:12.290
It's kind of nostalgic… and makes me feel safe.

00:17:17.250 --> 00:17:23.020
I don't know what's going to happen from now, but… I'll do my best, with this guy.

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:30.780
Are you okay?

00:17:30.780 --> 00:17:32.290
Was I heavy?

00:17:32.290 --> 00:17:35.990
It was… nothing.

00:17:36.430 --> 00:17:38.710
You're completely out of breath…

00:17:38.710 --> 00:17:42.430
Ah, there you are.

00:17:44.800 --> 00:17:49.080
Ah, Himeka-chan, welcome home!

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:51.360
So, you can walk alone now?

00:17:56.890 --> 00:18:01.570
What! What's with the sudden change of attitude!

00:18:02.250 --> 00:18:04.340
Not that I care.

00:18:11.740 --> 00:18:13.340
What should we do, nii-san?

00:18:14.220 --> 00:18:16.230
It's two on two.

00:18:16.230 --> 00:18:21.390
It's a bit unfortunate, but we'll just have to crush them one by one.

00:18:22.790 --> 00:18:24.750
Starting with the strongest?

00:18:24.750 --> 00:18:26.240
Or…

00:18:26.240 --> 00:18:28.080
From the weakest?

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:31.300
From the weakest, of course.

00:18:31.300 --> 00:18:34.040
That one will be easier to beat.

00:18:34.040 --> 00:18:37.450
The new amateur goddess.

00:18:47.380 --> 00:18:51.220
Cleaning duty really makes you late…

00:18:51.220 --> 00:18:52.940
Ah… did it come out again?

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:55.300
Shii-chan's ghost…

00:18:57.510 --> 00:18:59.230
Was it my imagination?

00:19:02.590 --> 00:19:05.790
Please! Just leave me alone now!

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:10.360
Ah! You're…

00:19:11.040 --> 00:19:16.320
You're quite brave to injure my facial charm, amateur goddess.

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:20.330
So you're the true identity of Shii-chan's ghost!

00:19:20.330 --> 00:19:21.890
You malicious glasses guy!

00:19:22.090 --> 00:19:25.730
I am no "malicious glasses guy", I'm Karasuma Kirio.

00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:34.580
But anyway, what was this ghost you were talking about?

00:19:35.020 --> 00:19:38.510
To make fun of my important Shii-chan… I won't forgive him!

00:19:39.830 --> 00:19:42.190
Anyway, I'll have you disappear here.

00:19:43.510 --> 00:19:47.110
Battle Transformation, using Hades' Power!

00:19:56.400 --> 00:19:57.600
With that, it's over.

00:19:57.600 --> 00:19:58.890
Karin!

00:20:01.410 --> 00:20:02.650
Kazune-kun!

00:20:02.650 --> 00:20:05.010
It seems you were a bit too slow!

00:20:07.050 --> 00:20:07.930
Karin!

00:20:11.460 --> 00:20:12.420
Who is it?

00:20:12.420 --> 00:20:13.860
That's…

00:20:17.220 --> 00:20:18.220
A cat?

00:20:18.220 --> 00:20:19.710
Shii-chan...

00:20:19.710 --> 00:20:23.190
A cat can't block my attacks.

00:20:27.710 --> 00:20:28.250
What?..

00:20:28.510 --> 00:20:31.480
Shii-chan… transformed?

00:20:36.520 --> 00:20:37.480
You…

00:20:40.120 --> 00:20:42.610
Are you alright, Karin?

00:20:42.610 --> 00:20:45.450
I'm fine, but more importantly…

00:20:47.290 --> 00:20:50.740
You saved me, didn't you… Shii-chan!

00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:58.300
Karin-chan! Long time no see!

00:20:58.300 --> 00:21:03.230
The cat… s-p-o-k-e!!!

00:21:06.230 --> 00:21:10.630
Shii-chan came back to life, what a surprise!

00:21:11.110 --> 00:21:15.560
No-no-no, I'm not Shii-chan.

00:21:15.560 --> 00:21:17.240
I'm a goddess.

00:21:17.240 --> 00:21:19.400
The goddess Nyake.

00:21:19.880 --> 00:21:21.560
Eh? Goddess?

00:21:22.010 --> 00:21:23.850
That's it!

00:21:23.850 --> 00:21:27.130
Athenya always had Nyake by her, it was perfect!

00:21:30.170 --> 00:21:33.580
There is cat fur… on your head?

00:21:30.170 --> 00:21:37.140
Himeka-chan misunderstanding of similar words.

00:21:34.020 --> 00:21:37.140
Athena had Nike, I think you mean to say.

00:21:43.270 --> 00:21:50.270
In Greek Mythology, whenever Athena won a battle, the goddess Nike was with her.

00:21:50.270 --> 00:21:51.710
Athena.

00:21:52.110 --> 00:21:55.680
The God that you're borrowing your powers from, a strong God.

00:21:56.320 --> 00:21:57.760
That's right!

00:21:57.760 --> 00:22:00.920
It seems like the other side thinks it's two on two.

00:22:01.480 --> 00:22:10.250
But we have Athenya... Apollo... and Nyake!

00:22:10.250 --> 00:22:12.970
So it's actually three on two!

00:22:13.370 --> 00:22:16.580
You know, if you're not a ghost you should have said so earlier.

00:22:16.580 --> 00:22:18.460
What are you talking about?!

00:22:18.780 --> 00:22:24.380
Every time I wanted to say something, you threw me somewhere!

00:22:27.250 --> 00:22:28.390
Oh, really?..

00:22:28.390 --> 00:22:30.150
Yes!~nya

00:22:50.030 --> 00:22:55.500
Totsuzen no sutorii hajimaru yo

00:22:50.030 --> 00:22:55.500
The story has suddenly begun…

00:22:55.500 --> 00:23:03.860
Ring hikari dasu

00:22:55.500 --> 00:23:03.860
…with the ring shining.

00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:09.280
Ate no nai tabiji wo kimi to

00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:09.280
I'm on an aimless journey with you,

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:15.750
Saa, hashire

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:15.750
Come, let's run.

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:31.180
Ima ruriiro somatta kono omoi wo

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:31.180
Right now, these azure feelings that have built up…

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:34.640
Yume mite koi shite

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:34.640
…that I've been dreaming of, and love…

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:45.030
Sora made ukande hakanai anemone

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:45.030
…are floating up into the sky, like a never wilting anemone.

00:23:45.030 --> 00:23:52.080
Todoku koto no nai tegami hoshi no you ni

00:23:45.030 --> 00:23:52.080
This letter that cannot be delivered, will become like a star…

00:23:52.080 --> 00:24:01.880
So yo kaze sayonara aa…

00:23:52.080 --> 00:24:01.880
Yes, it will have have to bid the wind farewell.

00:24:05.320 --> 00:24:11.770
Kazune-kun's Midterm Test Plan

00:24:06.120 --> 00:24:07.820
Next time on Kami-chama Karin:

00:24:07.820 --> 00:24:11.090
Kazune-kun's midterm test plan.

00:24:12.050 --> 00:24:18.930
Eh? If I do badly on my midterm tests, I'll be expelled!?
